<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's Costello to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's Costello to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello will hold a news conference at 10.15 a.m. (2315 GMT) after the Reserve Bank of Australia cut interest rates by 0.5 percent, his office said.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
